      <h1 id="dynamic-plugins-reference_{context}" class="group scroll-mt-20">Dynamic plugin reference<a href="#dynamic-plugins-reference_{context}" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
