      <TableCell>A function that will filter actions based on some conditions.<Fragment set:html={"<br>"} /><code>scope</code>: The scope in which actions should be provided for. A hook might be required if you want to remove the <code>ModifyCount</code> action from a deployment with a horizontal pod autoscaler (HPA).</TableCell>
