      <h3 id="_querybrowser" class="group scroll-mt-20"><code>QueryBrowser</code><a href="#_querybrowser" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p>A component that renders a graph of the results from a Prometheus PromQL query along with controls for interacting with the graph.</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"<QueryBrowser\n  defaultTimespan={15 * 60 * 1000}\n  namespace={namespace}\n  pollInterval={30 * 1000}\n  queries={[\n    'process_resident_memory_bytes{job=\"console\"}',\n    'sum(irate(container_network_receive_bytes_total[6h:5m])) by (pod)',\n  ]}\n/>"} lang="tsx" title="Example" />
